From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:28:11 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD visual-mode selection for terminal panes so focused
 text can be copied

Terminal command mode supports vim-style character, line, and block selections over the focused pane. The UI copies selected text through OSC 52 so left-pane rows and cached right-pane transcript rows can be yanked without sending navigation keys as prompt text.
