 path.
 
+In command mode, `v`, `V`, and `Ctrl-V` start character, line, and block visual selections in the
+focused pane. Visual-mode cursor movement stays inside the focused pane's currently rendered rows,
+and `y` or `Y` copies the selected text through an OSC 52 clipboard sequence before returning to
+command mode.
